## Next Steps

* **Hybrid Signatures**: The chairs will take the preference for adopting `-composite-ml-dsa` and rejecting `-pqt-dual-certs` to the mailing list to confirm working group consensus.
* **PAKE Draft**: The chairs will coordinate with the formal analysis team (FAT) to initiate the review of `draft-ietf-tls-pake`.